<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">8.&nbsp;<U>Entire Agreement</U>. This Agreement
constitutes the entire agreement and supersedes all prior agreements and understandings, both written and oral, between the parties with
